WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
Standing heavy kick and its heavy-punch continuation start the route.

2
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.700
The live heavy-punch Level 2 activates.

3
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:05.000
Standing medium kick connects before the first dash.

4
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:05.650
Crouching heavy punch launches after the first dash.

5
00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:06.400
Light Departure is placed during the automatic Super hits.

6
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:06.900
Standing heavy punch connects after the second dash.

7
00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:07.900
Medium Torbalan continues the carry.

8
00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:08.900
Forward heavy kick connects after another dash.

9
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:10.200
Heavy Stribog launches Ryu down the stage.

10
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:11.050
A second medium Torbalan catches the distant juggle.

11
00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:12.100
Heavy Triglav catches Ryu near the far wall.
